SUMMARY:Impromptu-TdRR Ride Previews 21\, 38 or 60
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n***Be Safe\, Have Fun\, a
 nd Ride Together***\n\nRide leader: Dave Stauffer\nAnticipated Average Pac
 e: 14-16 mph pace as agreed upon by attendees.\n\nWe have two TdRR routes 
 to preview from GS HS.\nRide 21\, 38 or 59 as you wish.\n\nI will extend o
 ne of the TdRR preview credits to another rider.\n\nRoute 1 at 8am from BI
 H Bake shop on Gibbons Rd. We will ride the back half of the BIH Bake Shop
  Loop: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-bird-in-hand-sticky-bu
 n-short-21f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-bird-in-hand-sti
 cky-bun-short-21f/) You can continue with the front half if you do not wan
 t to continue with Get a Life Lament.\n\nRoute 2 from GSHS at 9am: [https:
 //routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-get-a-life-lament-38vh/](https://rou
 tes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/gs-get-a-life-lament-38vh/)\n\nRoute 3: We w
 ill ride the front half of the BIH Bake Shop Loop:\n\nPlease RSVP or we wi
 ll not wait for you.\n\nFood or Ice Cream based on the group's preference 
 after the ride.\n\nThis is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule
  as the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group 
 together with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed a
 t the start.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and 
 a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo e
 liminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membe
 rship and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not me
 an you are a club member.\n\nJoin here [Member Signup](https://www.lancast
 erbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your 
 agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: [Code of Conduct](https:
 //www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n\nGui
 dance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3156042
 69/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260708T202429Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260708T202429Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
