SUMMARY:Trail ride  to Four Spring's Winery approx 32 miles RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Join your bicycle frien
 ds for a trail ride to Seven Springs and the Four Spring’s Winery. Leavi
 ng the John Rudy Trail parking lot\, 400 Mundis Race Rd\, at 2pm and bike 
 south through the city of York\, connecting to the Heritage Trail to the W
 inery. Most of these trails are crusherd gravel. On the return trip\, you 
 may choose to stop in York for food.**\n**This is a casual ride. (on the t
 rail\, 11mph or so) Please do not go on this ride unless you will stay wit
 h the group.**\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water an
 d a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n**
 To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require Meetup RSV
 P below to join this ride.**\n**Being on Meetup does not mean you are a cl
 ub member.**\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's:**\n**[
 Join the Club](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&c
 lub_id=257148)**\n**[Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com
 /content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)**\n**[Rules of t
 he Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club
 _id=257148&module_id=325159)**\n**[Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/docs.ashx?id=763523)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3154555
 70/
